  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya blessed land has large numbers of sound path dao marks. Lang Ya land spirit can transmit his voice easily, an ability Hu Immortal land spirit and Star Form land spirit lack.",
      "chapters": [
        875
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "char_fairy_bai_hu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "General dao marks and attainment levels are covered on dao marks and attainment.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_dao_marks"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among Fang Yuan’s dao marks, sound path dao marks number around thirteen thousand. They came from Tang Song, a rank seven supreme elder of Eastern Sea’s Tang clan.",
      "chapters": [
        1161
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "absorbed-from-tang-song",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_tang_song",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "fac_tang_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Feng Jiu Ge has only rank seven cultivation, but the abundant sound path dao marks on his body make his immortal killer moves match Wu Yong, with sound path dao mark accumulation on par with that rank eight.",
      "chapters": [
        1389
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-eight-parity",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "char_wu_yong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Full of sound path dao marks, Feng Jiu Ge cannot coexist with the River of Time’s time path dao marks.",
      "chapters": [
        1403
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "river-of-time-conflict",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_river_of_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With that conflict his sound path killer moves have less than ten percent of their original power, and the sound path dao marks are far inferior in quantity to the River of Time’s dao marks, turning his greatest advantage into a weakness.",
      "chapters": [
        1404
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "river-of-time-conflict",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In Western Desert’s anti-sound desert and Southern Border’s silent hill, sound path dao marks are extremely suppressed and all sound path killer moves are greatly weakened.",
      "chapters": [
        1420
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "anti-sound-desert",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_western_desert",
        "reg_southern_border"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Feng Jiu Ge’s accumulation is still so deep that even inside the anti-sound desert his power cannot be fully suppressed.",
      "chapters": [
        1422
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "anti-sound-desert",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Even without rank eight sound path Immortal Gu, Feng Jiu Ge’s killer moves can reach quasi-rank eight through dao mark amplification, because his sound path dao mark accumulation evenly matches rank eight.",
      "chapters": [
        1571
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "quasi-rank-eight-amplification",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A seashell left by the desolate beast giant music shell holds a vast number of sound path dao marks, so even a mortal’s voice inside spreads far and wide. Each merman’s throat has a cartilage filled with sound path dao marks; humans once slaughtered mermen to take that cartilage as sound path Gu material.",
      "chapters": [
        1666
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "music-shell-and-mermen",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Music clams are ordinary clams that contain sound path dao marks. At desolate beast level they become giant music clams; as ancient desolate beasts they shrink again into small music clams used as sound path immortal material.",
      "chapters": [
        1885
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "music-clams",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "res_small_music_clam"
      ]
    }
  ],
